# Core System Documentation

This section covers the fundamental backend components and core functionalities of the application, excluding specific UI or module implementations.

## Key Subsections

-   **[AiRudeDepot](./AiRudeDepot/)**: Documentation for the core data handling and storage abstraction layer.
-   **[Controllers](./Controllers/)**: Base controllers or core API endpoint logic.
-   **[Helpers](./Helpers/)**: Global helper functions and utility classes.
-   **[Installer](./Installer/)**: Components related to the application's installation or setup process.
-   **[Models](./Models/)**: Core Eloquent models or base data structures.
-   **[Routing](./routing/)**: Core application routing configuration, distinct from module-specific routing.
